        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Learned Counsel for the Respondent Nos. 1, 2 & 3, who appears on advance notice, has, however,\nplaced on record a detailed email dated 12th September, 2024 received from MEA setting out the various steps which were taken for safeguarding th"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f5c930d51c49403587f76568d015fe8b_15",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As per the said email, the Indian Embassy in Baku, Azerbaijan is stated to have received an email on 13th June, 2024 confirming the arrest of Mr. Devanshu Rathore."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3dc0865277c7420a8a0dcfc5c0537d7a_16",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Upon receiving the said email relating to the arrest of the detenue, the embassy officials have met the brother and sister-in-law of the detenue."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "083f609052de4fe5a85d45a3853c7932_17",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Further, an English speaking local advocate has also been engaged to pursue the case of the son of the Petitioner before the concerned Courts in Azerbaijan."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0afbfd7ad5bb49279ebee4bbb227e0a8_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The embassy had fixed a time for consular access for the brother of the Petitioner, however, he is stated to have not availed of the same."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5595aa20478f46b1a101a84cb4a31ee3_19",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "10. On 13th August, 2024, the embassy's consular official visited the detention centre and met the detenue, who expressed certain concerns with regard to food and medicine in the detention centre."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0206e83c7b1349f88a07093029505b48_20",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThe embassy consular official thereafter, has taken up issues relating to medicine, food, safety and security of the detenue with the concerned prison authorities."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9870f80ceede4620ac4e4c9d6d6a3b0f_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. It is stated in the email dated 12th September, 2024 that the embassy in Baku, Azerbaijan is in regular touch with the family of Mr. Devanshu Rathore."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e179da1823ec4d3aa3295a0338d9fbc2_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "12. The email dated 12th September, 2024 further clarifies that bail of Mr. Devanshu Rathore has been rejected by the concerned Court in Baku, Azerbaijan."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b1b56e77789a4a0886fe66b05b58b15f_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, presently, the process for extradition of the detenue to Monaco, which is the country where the complaint had originated, is under progress."
      },
